1 all off: cnt=xx q=xx hi=x lat=xx ack=0 core.cnt=xx
2 switch off: cnt=xx q=xx hi=x lat=xx ack=0 core.cnt=xx
3 switch on, not reset: cnt=xx q=ff hi=0 lat=xx ack=1 core.cnt=xx
35 core: cnt is 3
44 running: cnt=04 q=ff hi=0 lat=04 ack=1 core.cnt=04
45 isolated: cnt=00 q=00 hi=1 lat=04 ack=1 core.cnt=04
65 core off: cnt=00 q=00 hi=1 lat=04 ack=0 core.cnt=xx
66 input changed while off: cnt=00 q=00 hi=1 lat=04 ack=0 core.cnt=xx
67 core on, still isolated: cnt=00 q=00 hi=1 lat=04 ack=1 core.cnt=xx
68 isolation off: cnt=xx q=cc hi=0 lat=xx ack=1 core.cnt=xx
69 isolation control x: cnt=xx q=xx hi=x lat=xx ack=1 core.cnt=xx
90 reset again: cnt=02 q=cc hi=0 lat=02 ack=1 core.cnt=02
91 VDD off: cnt=xx q=xx hi=x lat=xx ack=1 core.cnt=xx
